Error [E0956]: `LayoutField.offset` is unavailable until a canonical target layout engine ships (D-LAYOUT-FACTS1=B)
  --> tests/ui/layout_byte_fact_refusal.jet:4:31
    |
  4 |     bytes :: layout.fields[0].offset
    |                               ^^^^^^
 Why: D-LAYOUT-FACTS1=B keeps byte facts absent until a canonical target layout engine exists
 Fix: read `kind`, `target`, `guarantee`, and `source`, or a field's `name` and `ty`; ship the canonical target layout engine before reading byte facts
